  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tgl2](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tgl2) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 111.763 depth occurred on Sep 11 2026 253 km ENE of Lospalos, Timor Leste. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.2863 longitude 128.9383. It impacted 4021 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
